{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/69260","id":4514990855,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABDR1LBw","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/69260","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/69260.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/69260.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/69260","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/69260/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/69260/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/69260/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/statuses/95ba937ff49786c104f3544850ddd20bff49eae6","number":69260,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix RouteHandlerAnalyzer Crash On Method Groups From Referenced Assemblies","user":{"login":"AzeemullahRg","id":61787698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzg3Njk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61787698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg","html_url":"https://github.com/AzeemullahRg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AzeemullahRg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`RouteHandlerAnalyzer` threw `IndexOutOfRangeException` (surfaced as `AD0001`) whenever a minimal API route handler was passed as a method group declared in a referenced assembly:\r\n\r\n```csharp\r\n// Handlers.GetById lives in a ProjectReference\r\napp.MapGet(\"/items/{id}\", Handlers.GetById);\r\n\r\nThe crash disabled the analyzer for the rest of the compilation and failed builds using TreatWarningsAsErrors.\r\n\r\nRoot cause\r\n\r\nDisallowNonParsableComplexTypesOnParameters read handlerDelegateParameter.DeclaringSyntaxReferences[0] for every parameter. Parameters of a method from another assembly are metadata symbols with no declaring syntax in the current compilation, so the array is empty and the index throws. The sibling checks (AtMostOneFromBodyAttribute, DisallowMvcBindArgumentsOnParameters) already guarded this case.\r\n\r\nFix\r\n\r\n- Use FirstOrDefault() for the parameter's declaring syntax.\r\n- When it is absent, report on the delegate expression passed to the Map* call. ASP0020 still points at Handlers.GetById instead of the analyzer crashing or the diagnostic being lost.\r\n- RouteHandlerAnalyzer passes delegateCreation.Syntax through at both call sites.\r\n\r\nTests\r\n\r\nAdded two tests to DisallowNonParsableComplexTypesOnParametersTest. A helper compiles the handler source into a separate in-memory assembly and adds it as a MetadataReference, so the analyzer sees metadata symbols exactly as with a ProjectReference:\r\n\r\n- Parsable string route parameter from a referenced assembly: no diagnostics (the reporter's scenario).\r\n- Non-parsable complex route parameter from a referenced assembly: one ASP0020 located on the method group expression.\r\n\r\nBoth tests fail with AD0001 without the fix and pass with it. The full RouteHandlers analyzer suite (111 tests) passes.\r\n\r\nFixes #68976\r\n```","labels":[{"id":1094843547,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDk0ODQzNTQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-infrastructure","name":"area-infrastructure","description":"Includes: MSBuild projects/targets, build scripts, CI, Installers and shared framework","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2209519932,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5NTE5OTMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/community-contribution","name":"community-contribution","description":"Indicates that the PR has been added by a community member","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5058451585,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABLYHYgQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/pending-ci-rerun","name":"pending-ci-rerun","description":"When assigned to a PR indicates that the CI checks should be rerun","color":"B60205","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-12T19:17:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:45:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d7683aeadc06a6ccd1df45dc04cc98fac8e6448b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"halter73","id":54385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73","html_url":"https://github.com/halter73","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/halter73/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admi